Hey everyone, this release adds 4 extended endings: Emily, Grace, Anne, Nina, Dragomira!

Changelog:
-Solved a bug that screwed up some of the final Love Interest choices: I suggest everyone to replay the whole of Chapter 9. Sorry for the mistake.
-Added about 7500 words;
-Added about 500 images;
-Added about 30 animations;


To learn more about the game visit the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/2384600/]community page[/url].



